source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: tpcds_q71"
---
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: ext_price DESC NULLS FIRST, brand_id ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |   Projection: item.i_brand_id AS brand_id, item.i_brand AS brand, time_dim.t_hour, time_dim.t_minute, sum(tmp.ext_price) AS ext_price                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[item.i_brand, item.i_brand_id, time_dim.t_hour, time_dim.t_minute]], aggr=[[sum(tmp.ext_price)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |       Projection: item.i_brand_id, item.i_brand, tmp.ext_price, time_dim.t_hour, time_dim.t_minute                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |         Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |  Projection: item.i_item_sk, item.i_brand_id, item.i_brand, tmp.ext_price, tmp.sold_item_sk, tmp.time_sk, time_dim.t_time_sk, time_dim.t_hour, time_dim.t_minute                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |   Inner Join:  Filter: tmp.time_sk = time_dim.t_time_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |     Inner Join:  Filter: tmp.sold_item_sk = item.i_item_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |       TableScan: item projection=[i_item_sk, i_brand_id, i_brand], full_filters=[item.i_manager_id = Int64(1)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: tmp                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |         Union                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |           Projection: web_sales.ws_ext_sales_price AS ext_price, web_sales.ws_item_sk AS sold_item_sk, web_sales.ws_sold_time_sk AS time_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: date_dim.d_date_sk = web_sales.ws_sold_date_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |               TableScan: web_sales projection=[ws_sold_date_sk, ws_sold_time_sk, ws_item_sk, ws_ext_sales_price]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |               TableScan: date_dim projection=[d_date_sk], full_filters=[date_dim.d_moy = Int64(11), date_dim.d_year = Int64(2001)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |           Projection: catalog_sales.cs_ext_sales_price AS ext_price, catalog_sales.cs_item_sk AS sold_item_sk, catalog_sales.cs_sold_time_sk AS time_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: date_dim.d_date_sk = catalog_sales.cs_sold_date_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |               TableScan: catalog_sales projection=[cs_sold_date_sk, cs_sold_time_sk, cs_item_sk, cs_ext_sales_price]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |               TableScan: date_dim projection=[d_date_sk], full_filters=[date_dim.d_moy = Int64(11), date_dim.d_year = Int64(2001)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |           Projection: store_sales.ss_ext_sales_price AS ext_price, store_sales.ss_item_sk AS sold_item_sk, store_sales.ss_sold_time_sk AS time_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: date_dim.d_date_sk = store_sales.ss_sold_date_sk                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |               TableScan: store_sales projection=[ss_sold_date_sk, ss_sold_time_sk, ss_item_sk, ss_ext_sales_price]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |               TableScan: date_dim projection=[d_date_sk], full_filters=[date_dim.d_moy = Int64(11), date_dim.d_year = Int64(2001)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |     TableScan: time_dim projection=[t_time_sk, t_hour, t_minute], full_filters=[time_dim.t_meal_time = Utf8("breakfast") OR time_dim.t_meal_time = Utf8("dinner")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [ext_price@4 DESC, brand_id@0 ASC NULLS LAST]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |   ProjectionExec: expr=[i_brand_id@1 as brand_id, i_brand@0 as brand, t_hour@2 as t_hour, t_minute@3 as t_minute, sum(tmp.ext_price)@4 as ext_price]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |     SortExec: expr=[sum(tmp.ext_price)@4 DESC, i_brand_id@1 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |       AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[i_brand@0 as i_brand, i_brand_id@1 as i_brand_id, t_hour@2 as t_hour, t_minute@3 as t_minute], aggr=[sum(tmp.ext_price)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([i_brand@0, i_brand_id@1, t_hour@2, t_minute@3], 32), input_partitions=32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |           AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[i_brand@1 as i_brand, i_brand_id@0 as i_brand_id, t_hour@3 as t_hour, t_minute@4 as t_minute], aggr=[sum(tmp.ext_price)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |             RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(32), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |               ProjectionExec: expr=[i_brand_id@1 as i_brand_id, i_brand@2 as i_brand, ext_price@3 as ext_price, t_hour@7 as t_hour, t_minute@8 as t_minute]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                 SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                   BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                     VirtualExecutionPlan name=sqlite compute_context=//data/accelerated_sqlite.db base_sql=SELECT `item`.`i_item_sk`, `item`.`i_brand_id`, `item`.`i_brand`, `tmp`.`ext_price`, `tmp`.`sold_item_sk`, `tmp`.`time_sk`, `time_dim`.`t_time_sk`, `time_dim`.`t_hour`, `time_dim`.`t_minute` FROM `item` INNER JOIN (SELECT `web_sales`.`ws_ext_sales_price` AS `ext_price`, `web_sales`.`ws_item_sk` AS `sold_item_sk`, `web_sales`.`ws_sold_time_sk` AS `time_sk` FROM `web_sales` INNER JOIN `date_dim` ON (`date_dim`.`d_date_sk` = `web_sales`.`ws_sold_date_sk`) WHERE (`date_dim`.`d_moy` = 11) AND (`date_dim`.`d_year` = 2001) UNION ALL SELECT `catalog_sales`.`cs_ext_sales_price` AS `ext_price`, `catalog_sales`.`cs_item_sk` AS `sold_item_sk`, `catalog_sales`.`cs_sold_time_sk` AS `time_sk` FROM `catalog_sales` INNER JOIN `date_dim` ON (`date_dim`.`d_date_sk` = `catalog_sales`.`cs_sold_date_sk`) WHERE (`date_dim`.`d_moy` = 11) AND (`date_dim`.`d_year` = 2001) UNION ALL SELECT `store_sales`.`ss_ext_sales_price` AS `ext_price`, `store_sales`.`ss_item_sk` AS `sold_item_sk`, `store_sales`.`ss_sold_time_sk` AS `time_sk` FROM `store_sales` INNER JOIN `date_dim` ON (`date_dim`.`d_date_sk` = `store_sales`.`ss_sold_date_sk`) WHERE (`date_dim`.`d_moy` = 11) AND (`date_dim`.`d_year` = 2001)) AS `tmp` ON (`tmp`.`sold_item_sk` = `item`.`i_item_sk`) INNER JOIN `time_dim` ON (`tmp`.`time_sk` = `time_dim`.`t_time_sk`) WHERE (`item`.`i_manager_id` = 1) AND ((`time_dim`.`t_meal_time` = 'breakfast') OR (`time_dim`.`t_meal_time` = 'dinner')) |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
